{
  "bvid": "BV1uA411D7Kp",
  "page": 1,
  "source": "subtitle-ai",
  "language": "ai-zh",
  "model": null,
  "content_sha256": "cd7dc97f5394a2f7bf55a87375954d35dc6cd0ed7a8ebf2772fd972560dc3709",
  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 780,
      "text": "我们也要讲一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 780,
      "end_ms": 4920,
      "text": "就是说急需打破的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 7440,
      "end_ms": 13620,
      "text": "急切的非常最急切的打破了一条罪恶链条"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 16900,
      "end_ms": 19800,
      "text": "我呼吁一切社会力量集中起来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 19800,
      "end_ms": 21300,
      "text": "打破这个罪恶链条"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 21300,
      "end_ms": 27820,
      "text": "这个罪恶链条就叫做啊实质上的童工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 27820,
      "end_ms": 28920,
      "text": "实质上的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 31280,
      "end_ms": 32680,
      "text": "同工链条啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 35440,
      "end_ms": 38240,
      "text": "未成年啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 38240,
      "end_ms": 41960,
      "text": "那法律明确不允许你这个劳务派遣工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 41960,
      "end_ms": 43820,
      "text": "合同工不能是同工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 43820,
      "end_ms": 48760,
      "text": "但是呢现在很多学校中专啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 48760,
      "end_ms": 52550,
      "text": "职中很多这种中专啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 52550,
      "end_ms": 53500,
      "text": "职校"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 55100,
      "end_ms": 59920,
      "text": "现在已经是可以说一些里面当中的腐败"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 59920,
      "end_ms": 61330,
      "text": "堕落的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 61330,
      "end_ms": 66540,
      "text": "这个啊校长啊或者什么的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 66540,
      "end_ms": 69480,
      "text": "这个辅导员老师上线病狂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 69480,
      "end_ms": 72780,
      "text": "和一些劳务中介派遣公司啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 72800,
      "end_ms": 75140,
      "text": "有着不可告人的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 75140,
      "end_ms": 76760,
      "text": "有什么不可告人就分钱呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 76760,
      "end_ms": 80200,
      "text": "一个罪恶链条把人摇到"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 80200,
      "end_ms": 81000,
      "text": "这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 81620,
      "end_ms": 87710,
      "text": "可以说是我们据我们目前掌握的一手的信息啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 87710,
      "end_ms": 90119,
      "text": "这是可以说是一件事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 90820,
      "end_ms": 92520,
      "text": "连轴转了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 92520,
      "end_ms": 96480,
      "text": "连轴转连轴转啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 96480,
      "end_ms": 98190,
      "text": "连轴转啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 98190,
      "end_ms": 100440,
      "text": "暑假有暑期工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 102700,
      "end_ms": 111980,
      "text": "暑期工这个这个事情呢适合近几年的学制紊乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 113540,
      "end_ms": 117760,
      "text": "好近几年h我说这个东西一定要立刻拨乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 117760,
      "end_ms": 121760,
      "text": "反正近几年疫情之下啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 121760,
      "end_ms": 124220,
      "text": "疫情下学制紊乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 124220,
      "end_ms": 125840,
      "text": "大学生还不上课了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 125840,
      "end_ms": 126860,
      "text": "对不对啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 126860,
      "end_ms": 131560,
      "text": "那对于这个这些中专职校学生更是学之紊乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 131560,
      "end_ms": 133540,
      "text": "他们什么时候上学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 133540,
      "end_ms": 134830,
      "text": "什么时候放假"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 134830,
      "end_ms": 136240,
      "text": "就是非常混乱的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 136240,
      "end_ms": 137080,
      "text": "管理很混乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 137080,
      "end_ms": 137950,
      "text": "学制紊乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 137950,
      "end_ms": 139090,
      "text": "然后还有什么呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 139090,
      "end_ms": 140720,
      "text": "产业衰退"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 141019,
      "end_ms": 142759,
      "text": "产业衰退的一个背景下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 142759,
      "end_ms": 146779,
      "text": "用工成本或者说产业经营的风险啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 146779,
      "end_ms": 148580,
      "text": "产业经营的风险很高"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 152260,
      "end_ms": 156400,
      "text": "那他就要啊就是不是他的那个利润率无法维持"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 158269,
      "end_ms": 160669,
      "text": "在产业衰退学之紊乱啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 160669,
      "end_ms": 163009,
      "text": "经营风险斗争了这几年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 163009,
      "end_ms": 165280,
      "text": "疫情这几年3年啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 165280,
      "end_ms": 168340,
      "text": "目前其实我们也是看就只是放开了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 168340,
      "end_ms": 170200,
      "text": "但疫情依然在延续啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 170220,
      "end_ms": 174280,
      "text": "在这种情况下出现了一个极大的一个乱象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 176399,
      "end_ms": 180580,
      "text": "极大的乱象就是以文凭为要挟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 182480,
      "end_ms": 190199,
      "text": "为要挟啊啊这个中专职校送学生工到流水线上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 190199,
      "end_ms": 193460,
      "text": "已经到了一个连轴转的一个程度了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 193460,
      "end_ms": 198140,
      "text": "连轴转就是说实际上已经逼这些人逼着学生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 198140,
      "end_ms": 201699,
      "text": "这是一种这是一种强迫就业啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 201699,
      "end_ms": 203100,
      "text": "这种强迫就业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 204820,
      "end_ms": 208780,
      "text": "这种强迫就业就是违背一些啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 210520,
      "end_ms": 213400,
      "text": "甚至说连轴转"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 215059,
      "end_ms": 219580,
      "text": "啊暑假漫长的暑期工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 219580,
      "end_ms": 221020,
      "text": "那么这个学制紊乱了嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 221020,
      "end_ms": 222760,
      "text": "啊这个啊节假日啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 222760,
      "end_ms": 227569,
      "text": "上学放假在这几年就是就是17攻一打"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 227569,
      "end_ms": 231060,
      "text": "打到个能够打到10月份"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 231060,
      "end_ms": 232020,
      "text": "11月份"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 232020,
      "end_ms": 235880,
      "text": "然后后面又立刻又是什么实习工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 235880,
      "end_ms": 238340,
      "text": "然后后面又变成寒假工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 239660,
      "end_ms": 241940,
      "text": "寒假工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 242760,
      "end_ms": 245300,
      "text": "这个年前年后的寒假工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 245300,
      "end_ms": 246740,
      "text": "年后还有寒年后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 246740,
      "end_ms": 248960,
      "text": "按道理要复学了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 248960,
      "end_ms": 251959,
      "text": "他这个学之紊乱不用去学校了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 251959,
      "end_ms": 253609,
      "text": "你继续在那边打工吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 253609,
      "end_ms": 257599,
      "text": "我导致流水线上大量的都是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 257599,
      "end_ms": 259980,
      "text": "中专职校的在校生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 261439,
      "end_ms": 264819,
      "text": "在校生之前说的好听是中专职校学生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 264819,
      "end_ms": 266139,
      "text": "你妈说难听点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 266139,
      "end_ms": 271700,
      "text": "其他的那个他的那个学习阶段相当于高中啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 272759,
      "end_ms": 274759,
      "text": "15 六七岁的样子啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 276079,
      "end_ms": 277279,
      "text": "啊这个叫童工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 277279,
      "end_ms": 278400,
      "text": "未成年人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 278800,
      "end_ms": 283150,
      "text": "那么这个是这个是非常非常严重的社会问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 283150,
      "end_ms": 286760,
      "text": "非常严重极为严重啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 286760,
      "end_ms": 288560,
      "text": "你不要看好像看上去是哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 288560,
      "end_ms": 289700,
      "text": "我用了一部分童工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 289700,
      "end_ms": 290890,
      "text": "但你已经违法了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 290890,
      "end_ms": 292270,
      "text": "这看上去不违法啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 292270,
      "end_ms": 293230,
      "text": "我叫他实习"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 293230,
      "end_ms": 296180,
      "text": "但实质上他不就是在那边连轴转的上班吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 296580,
      "end_ms": 298049,
      "text": "工资很少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 298049,
      "end_ms": 301229,
      "text": "工资相比正式工而言少了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 301229,
      "end_ms": 304439,
      "text": "我要在医学这个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 304439,
      "end_ms": 305729,
      "text": "医学生那边"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 305729,
      "end_ms": 310609,
      "text": "医药行业当中的这个这个这个这个这个规培生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 310609,
      "end_ms": 312900,
      "text": "只是这个现象的规培生啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 312900,
      "end_ms": 316560,
      "text": "只是这个现象的一个一个个例而已"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 316560,
      "end_ms": 318360,
      "text": "一个例子而已啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 322720,
      "end_ms": 324280,
      "text": "就这些中专职校学生而言"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 324280,
      "end_ms": 327260,
      "text": "他已经很普遍的出现了这种实质性同工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 327440,
      "end_ms": 329000,
      "text": "实质性同工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 329000,
      "end_ms": 332279,
      "text": "或者这样的强迫就业实质同工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 332279,
      "end_ms": 333239,
      "text": "强迫就业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 333239,
      "end_ms": 336749,
      "text": "而且是用他的这个学习啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 336749,
      "end_ms": 340200,
      "text": "强迫就业这个状况呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 340200,
      "end_ms": 343080,
      "text": "它是疫情这3年特殊状况之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 345240,
      "end_ms": 348400,
      "text": "危机化的大规律所导致的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 350800,
      "end_ms": 355879,
      "text": "一定要一定要及时的快速的拨乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 355879,
      "end_ms": 359460,
      "text": "反正否则这种情况远于连啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 359460,
      "end_ms": 361320,
      "text": "吃到嘴巴里的肉好"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 361320,
      "end_ms": 364380,
      "text": "他说或者说他一他通过这种强迫劳动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 364380,
      "end_ms": 366120,
      "text": "强迫就业啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 366120,
      "end_ms": 367260,
      "text": "强迫不再就业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 367260,
      "end_ms": 368220,
      "text": "强迫劳动啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 368220,
      "end_ms": 371979,
      "text": "强迫劳动实质性同工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 376360,
      "end_ms": 380050,
      "text": "其实只是维持了危机之前的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 380050,
      "end_ms": 384220,
      "text": "一个不那么高的资本增值率啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 384220,
      "end_ms": 389080,
      "text": "资本增值率他增值率并没有多高啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 389080,
      "end_ms": 390940,
      "text": "分值率并没有多高啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 390940,
      "end_ms": 392440,
      "text": "所以他这个暴雪降不下来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 392440,
      "end_ms": 395340,
      "text": "所以他这个东西好像看上去就没法取消"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 395500,
      "end_ms": 397720,
      "text": "这个纽带已经扭那么紧了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 397720,
      "end_ms": 399400,
      "text": "他松不了了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 399400,
      "end_ms": 402440,
      "text": "但是说我们要想尽一切办法啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 402440,
      "end_ms": 403700,
      "text": "如果不想一切办法来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 403700,
      "end_ms": 406160,
      "text": "来把这个这个情况解决掉的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 406160,
      "end_ms": 410580,
      "text": "那是巨大的变乱的变乱的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 411160,
      "end_ms": 412320,
      "text": "变乱的种子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 412320,
      "end_ms": 414120,
      "text": "这是个巨大的祸乱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 414120,
      "end_ms": 415230,
      "text": "由之而发"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 415230,
      "end_ms": 416160,
      "text": "为什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 416160,
      "end_ms": 420920,
      "text": "因为这些人这些人啊太年轻了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 133,
      "start_ms": 422840,
      "end_ms": 424180,
      "text": "太年轻了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 134,
      "start_ms": 425860,
      "end_ms": 427020,
      "text": "十几岁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 135,
      "start_ms": 428639,
      "end_ms": 430579,
      "text": "这些人如果做了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 430579,
      "end_ms": 432379,
      "text": "因为被逼得走投无路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 432379,
      "end_ms": 433609,
      "text": "做了一些激进的事情"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 433609,
      "end_ms": 435199,
      "text": "你说你是抓还是不抓"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 435199,
      "end_ms": 437400,
      "text": "抓了之后你是胖还是不胖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 438240,
      "end_ms": 439430,
      "text": "窗还是不报"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 439430,
      "end_ms": 440680,
      "text": "判还是不判"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 441319,
      "end_ms": 442059,
      "text": "这个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 442059,
      "end_ms": 445780,
      "text": "代表着就是说你让这十几岁的孩子承担责任吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 446080,
      "end_ms": 448300,
      "text": "那谁把他卖到这个产线上去的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 448300,
      "end_ms": 451540,
      "text": "或者说谁让他就说说没办法好好念了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 451540,
      "end_ms": 453460,
      "text": "这个技术培训"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 453460,
      "end_ms": 455040,
      "text": "没办法好好接受了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 455260,
      "end_ms": 461020,
      "text": "闹的那么闹的就是说一块去闹着激进化了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 461020,
      "end_ms": 463660,
      "text": "闹着去盲目的去做一些"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 463740,
      "end_ms": 466460,
      "text": "我要申请你们说违法犯罪的事儿了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 467000,
      "end_ms": 469250,
      "text": "你抓还是不怕判还是不判"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 469250,
      "end_ms": 472430,
      "text": "这个东西是个非常难搞的东西啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 472430,
      "end_ms": 474230,
      "text": "这个情况如果普遍化的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 474230,
      "end_ms": 478710,
      "text": "那这个就会成为霍乱的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 478710,
      "end_ms": 480630,
      "text": "霍乱由此而生啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 480630,
      "end_ms": 482370,
      "text": "祸乱由此而生也"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 482370,
      "end_ms": 486480,
      "text": "而且这个东西我拿我实事求是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 486480,
      "end_ms": 489330,
      "text": "这样就是说同工现象的一个结局"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 489330,
      "end_ms": 491040,
      "text": "同工现象的一个结束"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 491040,
      "end_ms": 491940,
      "text": "一个解决"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 491940,
      "end_ms": 495499,
      "text": "它实际上是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 495499,
      "end_ms": 496820,
      "text": "它实际上是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 504250,
      "end_ms": 505770,
      "text": "解决童工现象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 505770,
      "end_ms": 510079,
      "text": "实际上也是使得这个啊儿童啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 510079,
      "end_ms": 513780,
      "text": "不要啊过早的啊背"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 514620,
      "end_ms": 516860,
      "text": "因为一方面他是个经济压迫状况"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 516860,
      "end_ms": 521000,
      "text": "另外一方面这个东西它会成为政治浪潮啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 521000,
      "end_ms": 524058,
      "text": "儿童不要过早就卷入这样的政治浪潮当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 526480,
      "end_ms": 527760,
      "text": "因为你会发现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 527760,
      "end_ms": 532680,
      "text": "如果这样会就会引起啊底层群众绝望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 532680,
      "end_ms": 533430,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 533430,
      "end_ms": 534599,
      "text": "绝望啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 535280,
      "end_ms": 538840,
      "text": "绝望以及是重大的一个失望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 538840,
      "end_ms": 544680,
      "text": "他对于一个就是个人家庭未来的一个绝望啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 544680,
      "end_ms": 547560,
      "text": "你那个那些年长的工人打了工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 547560,
      "end_ms": 552439,
      "text": "看到这15 六岁甚至14 五岁的黄毛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 552520,
      "end_ms": 554590,
      "text": "就是这种小头小子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 554590,
      "end_ms": 557480,
      "text": "竟然也和他一样走投无路"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 557480,
      "end_ms": 558920,
      "text": "那我说我结什么婚"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 558920,
      "end_ms": 559970,
      "text": "生什么小孩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 559970,
      "end_ms": 563250,
      "text": "我结什么家庭来吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 563250,
      "end_ms": 566730,
      "text": "这个会导致个人对于这个家庭婚姻"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 566730,
      "end_ms": 568350,
      "text": "对于社会财产关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 571120,
      "end_ms": 574540,
      "text": "整个市民阶级的家庭再生产都绝望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 575020,
      "end_ms": 578300,
      "text": "另外一方面他也会非常失望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 578480,
      "end_ms": 579500,
      "text": "非常失望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 583040,
      "end_ms": 583940,
      "text": "最代表"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 583940,
      "end_ms": 587360,
      "text": "或者说最无知最弱小的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 587360,
      "end_ms": 589640,
      "text": "就是还还是不在那样被欺受"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 589640,
      "end_ms": 591200,
      "text": "受着压迫欺辱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 591200,
      "end_ms": 594760,
      "text": "他会会有无限的失望啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 594760,
      "end_ms": 598490,
      "text": "会处在一个无限的失望和愤慨当中啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 598490,
      "end_ms": 599720,
      "text": "和愤慨当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 599720,
      "end_ms": 601460,
      "text": "所以我要说的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 601460,
      "end_ms": 602690,
      "text": "我要说的对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 602690,
      "end_ms": 603530,
      "text": "各方面要说的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 603530,
      "end_ms": 605439,
      "text": "我们要想尽办法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 605440,
      "end_ms": 607120,
      "text": "你们不是说我饱吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 607120,
      "end_ms": 610720,
      "text": "那我那我就说了这个罪恶链条"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 610720,
      "end_ms": 613930,
      "text": "这个罪恶链条啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 613930,
      "end_ms": 617380,
      "text": "这个罪恶链条我们叫做实质性的同工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 617380,
      "end_ms": 619000,
      "text": "实质性的同工"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 620700,
      "end_ms": 623300,
      "text": "或者以教育教育啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 623300,
      "end_ms": 626120,
      "text": "以教育为幌子的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 626920,
      "end_ms": 630000,
      "text": "或者压着人家的那个职业准入"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 630000,
      "end_ms": 633800,
      "text": "职业准入资格的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 633800,
      "end_ms": 636760,
      "text": "来来进行这个强迫劳动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 638360,
      "end_ms": 639880,
      "text": "啊强迫劳动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 639880,
      "end_ms": 643480,
      "text": "而且是个极低性的强迫劳动啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 643480,
      "end_ms": 644440,
      "text": "吉利性的强迫劳动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 644440,
      "end_ms": 648280,
      "text": "而是产线上相对地形学能够相对地形"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 648280,
      "end_ms": 650320,
      "text": "你这个龟培生那是极地性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 650320,
      "end_ms": 652540,
      "text": "1000块钱一个月啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 652540,
      "end_ms": 656120,
      "text": "这个作业链条早早斩断啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 656120,
      "end_ms": 657860,
      "text": "早早斩断开"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 657860,
      "end_ms": 660079,
      "text": "我的建议就是抓一批"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 660300,
      "end_ms": 661920,
      "text": "抓一批既得利者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 662940,
      "end_ms": 665140,
      "text": "然后是立一批规矩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 665320,
      "end_ms": 667570,
      "text": "好的一批规矩啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 667570,
      "end_ms": 668710,
      "text": "一批规矩"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 676430,
      "end_ms": 678620,
      "text": "直接尼玛去直接把他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 678620,
      "end_ms": 681910,
      "text": "这这让他们和不战阶级平等劳动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 683770,
      "end_ms": 685810,
      "text": "让他们手上权力全部取消掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 685810,
      "end_ms": 688740,
      "text": "哎这是我的建议啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 688740,
      "end_ms": 689280,
      "text": "我的建议"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 689280,
      "end_ms": 694450,
      "text": "目前这个问题其实啊有一些症状了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 694450,
      "end_ms": 695770,
      "text": "已经有一些征兆了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 695770,
      "end_ms": 698380,
      "text": "已经有一些征兆了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 698380,
      "end_ms": 699550,
      "text": "已经有些征兆了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 699550,
      "end_ms": 704460,
      "text": "我希望啊这些年轻的稚嫩的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 704460,
      "end_ms": 705330,
      "text": "幼稚的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 705330,
      "end_ms": 707280,
      "text": "有的时候是迷茫无知的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 707280,
      "end_ms": 709180,
      "text": "这些迷茫无知"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 709180,
      "end_ms": 711520,
      "text": "当然也有一些有一些迷茫无知之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 711520,
      "end_ms": 713140,
      "text": "也有一些朴素的正义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 713140,
      "end_ms": 714479,
      "text": "朴素的正义感"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 714700,
      "end_ms": 717010,
      "text": "或者说朴素的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 717010,
      "end_ms": 722170,
      "text": "想要就是呃初生牛犊不怕虎的那种勇敢啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 722170,
      "end_ms": 723820,
      "text": "那也可以说是鲁莽了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 723820,
      "end_ms": 725200,
      "text": "鲁莽啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 730830,
      "end_ms": 732570,
      "text": "他在成长过程当中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 732570,
      "end_ms": 734670,
      "text": "他不断的被被打击"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 734670,
      "end_ms": 735630,
      "text": "不断被打压"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 735630,
      "end_ms": 737670,
      "text": "然后不断地磨圆他的棱角"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 737670,
      "end_ms": 742030,
      "text": "但是这个棱角你现在直接让他到产线上去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 742030,
      "end_ms": 743500,
      "text": "然后这个产线又怎么样"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 743500,
      "end_ms": 744760,
      "text": "又又压迫他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 744760,
      "end_ms": 746560,
      "text": "直接让他失学失业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 746580,
      "end_ms": 749199,
      "text": "不是这直接让他们失学失业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 750500,
      "end_ms": 753330,
      "text": "然后他他的这些孩子的父母"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 753330,
      "end_ms": 755070,
      "text": "父母本身又有何希望了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 755070,
      "end_ms": 756030,
      "text": "也是无希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 756030,
      "end_ms": 756630,
      "text": "没有希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 756630,
      "end_ms": 757470,
      "text": "没有盼头的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 757470,
      "end_ms": 762950,
      "text": "父母的希望盼头就是这些孩子可以得学得也啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 762950,
      "end_ms": 764510,
      "text": "可以就学立业吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 764510,
      "end_ms": 765740,
      "text": "可以就学立业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 765740,
      "end_ms": 768920,
      "text": "但是他被迫的直接把他们赶到产业上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 768920,
      "end_ms": 770640,
      "text": "然后拼命的压榨他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 770680,
      "end_ms": 772030,
      "text": "被迫离开"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 772030,
      "end_ms": 773080,
      "text": "被迫失血"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 773080,
      "end_ms": 774260,
      "text": "被迫失业"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 774400,
      "end_ms": 775540,
      "text": "这种情况之下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 775540,
      "end_ms": 777250,
      "text": "父母本身也没有什么希望了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 777250,
      "end_ms": 781260,
      "text": "那么这些孩子他的锋芒棱角"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 781260,
      "end_ms": 784440,
      "text": "或者说他的呃愚鲁鲁莽啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 784440,
      "end_ms": 786060,
      "text": "他的幼稚迷茫"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 786060,
      "end_ms": 790520,
      "text": "一下子也就以啊一些激进的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 790520,
      "end_ms": 796440,
      "text": "一些当然实际上也不会有特别大的效果的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 796440,
      "end_ms": 798839,
      "text": "一种方式表现出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 799220,
      "end_ms": 803120,
      "text": "但是我看到的我其实我也看到了一种担当啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 803120,
      "end_ms": 804500,
      "text": "我看到了一种担当"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 804500,
      "end_ms": 805520,
      "text": "一人做事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 805520,
      "end_ms": 806359,
      "text": "一人当"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 806720,
      "end_ms": 808010,
      "text": "一人做事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 808010,
      "end_ms": 810480,
      "text": "一人当啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 810480,
      "end_ms": 813270,
      "text": "一人张木累积家庭啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 813270,
      "end_ms": 815900,
      "text": "不累及家庭啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 815900,
      "end_ms": 817160,
      "text": "布雷及父母"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 817160,
      "end_ms": 819440,
      "text": "这其实是有一种朴素的正义感"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 819440,
      "end_ms": 821459,
      "text": "他也知道自己做了错事"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 821660,
      "end_ms": 824500,
      "text": "愿意见处罚啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 824500,
      "end_ms": 826300,
      "text": "我们只是说在这种情况下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 826300,
      "end_ms": 831740,
      "text": "我们说他内心深处还是希望有某种秩序啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 831740,
      "end_ms": 833480,
      "text": "我们不说这是幻想还是妄想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 833480,
      "end_ms": 835070,
      "text": "反正他有这种希望"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 835070,
      "end_ms": 838410,
      "text": "有某种秩序给他主持公道啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 838410,
      "end_ms": 840020,
      "text": "那我们要讲的说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 840280,
      "end_ms": 844760,
      "text": "那么这个秩序如何给予一个直接的回应"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 844980,
      "end_ms": 846660,
      "text": "这个不是我要考虑的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 846660,
      "end_ms": 848160,
      "text": "这个是考验啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 848160,
      "end_ms": 851940,
      "text": "各个层级的不同的这个知识的主导者的智慧的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 851940,
      "end_ms": 854360,
      "text": "另外一方面根源"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 854360,
      "end_ms": 855500,
      "text": "哎我说了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 855500,
      "end_ms": 858440,
      "text": "我没有办法在公开媒体上讨论"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 858440,
      "end_ms": 860270,
      "text": "那个更深层次的根源"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 860270,
      "end_ms": 862359,
      "text": "那我就说这个罪恶链条"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 862520,
      "end_ms": 866780,
      "text": "这个就是祸患基于昼夜儿啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 867460,
      "end_ms": 871160,
      "text": "昼夜猪肘子肘腋毛的叶叶子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 871640,
      "end_ms": 877219,
      "text": "唉我不就不就啊呀这个啊破万句昼夜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 877400,
      "end_ms": 879080,
      "text": "这个这个不好搞的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 879080,
      "end_ms": 879680,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 879680,
      "end_ms": 881750,
      "text": "这个东西很难弄的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 881750,
      "end_ms": 883000,
      "text": "没有吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 883780,
      "end_ms": 887100,
      "text": "你说当年二爷是15 16岁初中生的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 887100,
      "end_ms": 892500,
      "text": "你就不能让来的这个一定要万分小心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 892500,
      "end_ms": 894780,
      "text": "万分小心再小心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 894780,
      "end_ms": 896160,
      "text": "不过啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 897340,
      "end_ms": 903290,
      "text": "就是说地头蛇这些其实是什么破破玩意嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 903290,
      "end_ms": 905750,
      "text": "其实这个这事我爸当年在广西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 905750,
      "end_ms": 908920,
      "text": "我靠跟那种什么民族学校怎么拉人头啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 908920,
      "end_ms": 910000,
      "text": "也是让学生工啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 910000,
      "end_ms": 911140,
      "text": "拉到什么当"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 911140,
      "end_ms": 913030,
      "text": "当时好像也是郑州富士康啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 913030,
      "end_ms": 915380,
      "text": "但是他最后他没挣到钱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 915780,
      "end_ms": 919440,
      "text": "他钱全被那些就是成体系的那种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 919440,
      "end_ms": 921859,
      "text": "劳务公司给挣走了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 922320,
      "end_ms": 923520,
      "text": "他说他也穷"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 923520,
      "end_ms": 924000,
      "text": "响叮当"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 924000,
      "end_ms": 924930,
      "text": "但是他有罪恶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 924930,
      "end_ms": 927360,
      "text": "我爸当年做的那些事有罪恶啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 927360,
      "end_ms": 929190,
      "text": "他是个啊啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 929190,
      "end_ms": 932660,
      "text": "他是个没人性的人头贩子啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 932660,
      "end_ms": 934100,
      "text": "他他有有有罪恶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 934100,
      "end_ms": 936380,
      "text": "那么这个这个罪恶链条里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 936380,
      "end_ms": 940439,
      "text": "那些家伙其实按个算没有什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 940780,
      "end_ms": 942580,
      "text": "没有什么强大的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 944380,
      "end_ms": 946660,
      "text": "好像就是这种啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 946660,
      "end_ms": 947440,
      "text": "有教育系统"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 947440,
      "end_ms": 950220,
      "text": "人设系统里面的这些货色"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 954480,
      "end_ms": 956800,
      "text": "抓ip干掉一批啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 956800,
      "end_ms": 957670,
      "text": "这是我的观点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 957670,
      "end_ms": 959080,
      "text": "this is my opinion"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 959080,
      "end_ms": 959680,
      "text": "这是我的观点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 959680,
      "end_ms": 963640,
      "text": "因为这个东西这个东西损伤的东西太严重"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 963640,
      "end_ms": 964860,
      "text": "太大了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 964860,
      "end_ms": 968430,
      "text": "这个群众的那个影响太坏了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 968430,
      "end_ms": 970110,
      "text": "太长远了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 970110,
      "end_ms": 971100,
      "text": "这个太长远了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 971100,
      "end_ms": 973040,
      "text": "这年轻人未来还有几十年"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 973160,
      "end_ms": 974780,
      "text": "近百年的未来呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 974780,
      "end_ms": 976280,
      "text": "那个如果活的寿命长一点"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 976280,
      "end_ms": 978020,
      "text": "就能够活八九十岁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 978020,
      "end_ms": 978800,
      "text": "100岁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 978800,
      "end_ms": 980670,
      "text": "还有一整个世纪呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 980670,
      "end_ms": 983160,
      "text": "这整个整个21世纪属于他们"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 347,
      "start_ms": 983160,
      "end_ms": 984680,
      "text": "他才15 六岁"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 348,
      "start_ms": 985540,
      "end_ms": 989420,
      "text": "你怎么得怎么得出未来一整个世纪呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 349,
      "start_ms": 989640,
      "end_ms": 992280,
      "text": "一整个21世纪怎么能得得罪呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 350,
      "start_ms": 992280,
      "end_ms": 995809,
      "text": "就为了眼前的这个为了2023年的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 351,
      "start_ms": 995809,
      "end_ms": 998389,
      "text": "一点点的那一点点微小的力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 352,
      "start_ms": 998389,
      "end_ms": 1000790,
      "text": "已经得罪一整个世纪啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 353,
      "start_ms": 1000790,
      "end_ms": 1002170,
      "text": "不可如此"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 354,
      "start_ms": 1002170,
      "end_ms": 1004000,
      "text": "不应当如此啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 355,
      "start_ms": 1004000,
      "end_ms": 1005170,
      "text": "我说的对对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 356,
      "start_ms": 1005170,
      "end_ms": 1006380,
      "text": "处理这种问题"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 357,
      "start_ms": 1007260,
      "end_ms": 1010280,
      "text": "又要又坚决的合纵罪恶链条做斗争"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 358,
      "start_ms": 1010280,
      "end_ms": 1012380,
      "text": "如果你被这样的罪恶链条欺负了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 359,
      "start_ms": 1012380,
      "end_ms": 1015800,
      "text": "要坚决在公共平台上发出你的声音"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 360,
      "start_ms": 1016860,
      "end_ms": 1018320,
      "text": "你就发出声音"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 361,
      "start_ms": 1018320,
      "end_ms": 1020210,
      "text": "总比你那个是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 362,
      "start_ms": 1020210,
      "end_ms": 1025140,
      "text": "这个这个抓举做抓举这种动作"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 363,
      "start_ms": 1025140,
      "end_ms": 1029220,
      "text": "要要要要要要好多了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 364,
      "start_ms": 1029220,
      "end_ms": 1030329,
      "text": "大胆地发出声音"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 365,
      "start_ms": 1030329,
      "end_ms": 1030930,
      "text": "我听我的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 366,
      "start_ms": 1030930,
      "end_ms": 1032480,
      "text": "我老实说啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 367,
      "start_ms": 1032480,
      "end_ms": 1036650,
      "text": "你就是有总有一天又会意识到愿意说话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 368,
      "start_ms": 1036650,
      "end_ms": 1041839,
      "text": "已经是在表示一个合作的意向了啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 369,
      "start_ms": 1041839,
      "end_ms": 1043760,
      "text": "表示一个大家还有的谈呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 370,
      "start_ms": 1043760,
      "end_ms": 1045859,
      "text": "咱这至少还认为大家可以谈的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 371,
      "start_ms": 1045859,
      "end_ms": 1047119,
      "text": "已经是个合作的意向"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 372,
      "start_ms": 1047119,
      "end_ms": 1048200,
      "text": "支持的意向了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 373,
      "start_ms": 1048200,
      "end_ms": 1048830,
      "text": "好吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 374,
      "start_ms": 1048830,
      "end_ms": 1049800,
      "text": "那就讲到这里啊"
